  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-12-15T06:30:08.788Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The \"Friend Locations\" display solved the problem we used to have with needing to click on each friend one-by-one to see where they were and if they were joinable. I've experienced dramatically more social interaction since this display was introduced and it's been significantly easier to organically discover more worlds and events.\n\nGroups have now recreated that old problem. Even if/when a more useful Group+ instance type is added it'll still be vastly inferior to Friends+ in many cases since it's so much harder for people to notice a group instance is available.\n\nThere should be one unified screen for checking all joinable friend and group instances.",
